{
    "title": "Food Bazaar",
    "description": "The Food Bazaar app will super-charge your shopping experience! Download today to take advantage of a variety of useful features:\r\n- Up-to-the-second loyalty points information to maximize your ability to shop and save and take advantage of more bonus opportunities.\r\n-  Access more ways to save - from tons of weekly and daily deals available directly from the app to a massively expanded coupon program.\r\n- A new and improved shopping list feature that groups future purchases together for shopping convenience! Add items from anywhere in the app. Easily check off items as you go throughout the store! \r\n- Access the weekly ad flyer directly from your phone.\r\n_ Add any offers directly to your wallet list, all with one click!\r\n- An improved store locator feature that allows you to select a home store or find out anything you need to know about the nearest Food Bazaar location (including directions)!\r\nLook out for future updates and enhancements as we continue to deliver the best possible shopping experience for our customers.\r\nLeave us feedback at info@foodbazaar.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Food Bazaar app will super-charge your shopping experience! Download today to take advantage of a variety of useful features:<br>- Up-to-the-second loyalty points information to maximize your ability to shop and save and take advantage of more bonus opportunities.<br>-  Access more ways to save - from tons of weekly and daily deals available directly from the app to a massively expanded coupon program.<br>- A new and improved shopping list feature that groups future purchases together for shopping convenience! Add items from anywhere in the app. Easily check off items as you go throughout the store! <br>- Access the weekly ad flyer directly from your phone.<br>_ Add any offers directly to your wallet list, all with one click!<br>- An improved store locator feature that allows you to select a home store or find out anything you need to know about the nearest Food Bazaar location (including directions)!<br>Look out for future updates and enhancements as we continue to deliver the best possible shopping experience for our customers.<br>Leave us feedback at info@foodbazaar.com.",
